# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Language bindings — each is a standalone Cargo package with its own
# target/ dir, plus NAPI-rs / maturin generated artifacts. Source files
# under bindings/**/src/, bindings/**/tests/, the manifests, and the
# READMEs are committed; everything else is build output.
bindings/**/target/
bindings/**/Cargo.lock
bindings/acdp-py/.venv/
bindings/acdp-py/*.so
bindings/acdp-py/dist/
bindings/acdp-node/node_modules/
# index.js + index.d.ts are the napi-generated loader/type defs. They are
# committed (not ignored) because the bindings-release publish job does not
# run `napi build`, so the root `acdp` package needs them present at publish
# time. Regenerate with `npm run build` after any change to the exported API.
bindings/acdp-node/acdp.*.node
bindings/acdp-node/package-lock.json
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Coverage
*.profraw
*.profdata
/lcov.info
/coverage/

# Local-only configuration
.envrc
.env

plans/
temp/
CLAUDE.md
.claude/